        "original_id": "ea6a9877-c145-5ee5-899d-8ec79a19d7ac",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Associazione Sportiva Roma, Lazio, Inter\n- People: Walter Samuel, Javier Zanetti\n- Competitions: Serie A\n- Topics: league titles, defensive reputation\n\nFacts:\n- In 2001, Associazione Sportiva Roma won its third Serie A league title after previous titles in 1942 and 1983.\n- In 2001, Associazione Sportiva Roma won Serie A one year after rival Lazio had won the league.\n- Walter Samuel has been regarded as one of the best centre-backs of his generation and one of football's toughest defenders.\n- Javier Zanetti, Walter Samuel's former international teammate and Inter captain, called Walter Samuel the hardest player he had played with.",
